# @hub-lanes

# ── ARCHIE FACTORY MANAGER LANE (BH-4583) ───────────────────────────────────
# Every 10 minutes Archie reads each project's open PRs and runs ONE playbook
# per stuck PR. Wave 1 knows one: a PR stacked on a parent that merged is
# replayed onto the parent's base with only its own commits, its suites run,
# it is retargeted and pushed with a lease; a conflict or red suites park it
# for bin/blocked-resolver.sh instead. Every action is claimed as an
# archie_actions row before any write, so a second tick does nothing; flock -n
# dedupes. Off: ARCHIE_FM_ENABLED=0, flags/lane-off-archie-fm,
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off archie-fm, or the settings row archie.manage=off.
*/10 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/archie-fm.sh --dispatch >> /root/harness/logs/archie-fm-cron.log 2>&1
